@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title OpenData 4.0.0 — Maven Dependencies (4.1.0 Refactor)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction

package "Runtime assembly (no reverse dependencies)" {
    [opendata-launcher] as Launcher
}
package "Core application" {
    [opendata-core] as Core
    [JavaFX GUI and first-run wizard] as Gui
    [CLI and execution coordinator] as Executor
}
package "Shared dependencies" {
    [opendata-api] as Api
    [opendata-common] as Common
}
package "Provider implementations" {
    [opendata-plugins] as Plugins
    [electricity support] as ElectricSupport
    [octopus support] as OctopusSupport
}
Launcher --> Core : assembly
Launcher --> Common : support JAR
Launcher --> Plugins : provider JARs
Core --> Api : compile only
Common --> Api : contracts
Plugins --> Api : plugin contracts
Plugins --> Common : shared helpers
Plugins --> ElectricSupport
Plugins --> OctopusSupport
Gui -[hidden]-> Executor
Core -- Gui
Core -- Executor
note bottom of Core
  Core does not declare dependencies on
  Common or provider implementations.
end note
@enduml
